==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{pathology}} A [[disorder]] of [[infancy]] and early [[childhood]] caused by a [[deficiency]] of [[vitamin D]], causing soft bones.

====Synonyms====
* [[rachitis]], [[rhachitis]]

====Related terms====
* [[ricketiness]]
* [[rickety]]

